# The fetched tier of the real-part corpus (ADR-0026 §2): every file
# tools/real-parts.sh surveys, pinned by its SHA-256, as `sha256sum -c`
# reads it, relative to target/real-parts/files/. `pmi/` is NIST's
# NIST-PMI-STEP-Files.zip less its AP203 geometry-only files (the
# committed tier, tests/fixtures/real/), `d2mi/` NIST-D2MI-Models.zip.
# Both are US-government works NIST publishes "without any restrictions".
